{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>周星馳（星爺）近年積極佈局短劇市場，繼旗下「九五二七劇場」推出首部微短劇《金豬玉葉》後，他再度攜手抖音平台，趁代表作《食神》上映30周年之際，啟動短劇版《食神2026》。</p><p>該劇已於5月31日在橫店正式開機，將是一部復仇爽劇，周星馳將以出品人及總監製身份參與制作，不親自執導，但劇中將保留「黯然銷魂飯」等經典元素。</p><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》宣傳海報（微博@趙夕汐工作室）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139260886012137472732108.png/iyF6Lea3QmMAEIEtpNAFzgeRzUK2CGPoS-5VUkvuVVI\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》宣傳海報（微博@趙夕汐工作室）</figcaption></figure><p>《食神2026》共30集，每集約三分鐘，預計於9月上線。劇集以食品安全為核心議題，延續《食神》精神，但敘事轉向當代社會寫實與小人物逆襲路線。</p><p>點擊查看《食神2026》的演員名單：</p><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261776282521600840795.jpeg/-W4A_tO0S1fO59t5kIMC8CEV7MTVh1eQEHcqPBB3Kjw\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261778392387584869453.jpeg/cJ9B3OhgN0OO9Sk9NuegU7ydDXcg8d5QATV5UwE1eVM\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261780527419392693178.jpeg/LrTPEZUcWxbDIvKo_qRaYVARge_XhE4WO-TniDvk54g\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261782612119552745920.jpeg/ISogrJIrsHXccN57s0SV-00T9AyeiiGgDsEWww7BFsM\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261784772317184876425.jpeg/Ax4Vh1tnHiSPdgDTHz4pTisQ0-b92-V9q3SMp6t0jKc\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261776014086144319068.jpeg/munjuJbuLc0x33XJFM66YoeWn-XULorsuDbYMrg22DI\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261778274947072453019.jpeg/deFGh84UZpSAJ_fo1UkO0-_T9dcpexs8U7hXUlO4V1I\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139261780405784576340261.jpeg/v8DGecxLC7rmr0b_ddlc3foyB2ZzwzqBUOSfRVDkn0U\"/><figcaption>《食神2026》演員表（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>劇情描述小攤主陳星（劉浩群飾）因女兒食用「味王集團」問題食品而患病。他在維權過程中反遭脅迫，被迫冒充失蹤的食神「史蒂芬周」，淪為黑心企業傀儡。陳星在忍辱負重之下，與妻子火雞（趙夕汐飾）聯手受害群眾，揭發餐飲巨頭森爺的黑色產業鏈。</p><p>更多趙夕汐的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262987475881984760825.jpeg/szLFi6AWeKYgeKuXc7SxXvkKwolQnxI-klkqy5JZKss\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262989908709376310857.jpeg/AiBeG9bU2J_-vqouazPCwWeHm5YsEoGF4lW9PeJVvT0\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262992890990592963784.jpeg/L68pc3dv5GeOaXbeD6sTtKn6W1eSNSqXBYzeoQWM3qE\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262995265097728637409.jpeg/Q5HojaYGsDpoiByk8v83SE7_6LpBkVCsw9qfhsPan4Y\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262998410956800508961.jpeg/2hv1OM44ECFaQqrc5caCTFXhJo_sEMhJbU05dG1NOXQ\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262990692913152401258.jpeg/mgcqLmUG94DtYmOPTsUC-LbB036gf5oYQSdiK0EnYis\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262993264152576518974.jpeg/hSW9csuW-XbJYSKnWoKIDAzALbuBq2jyq_yo4av8qOE\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262995961221120027865.jpeg/eRRiXspQP77ky-Rl5w-LYonHRZ6ghW50lXGojZVxqI0\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139262999136440320634250.jpeg/n3WcVnvH4h-sJcPThoZFPlhAuONL1rD97nwDku58A5I\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139263002265522176031875.jpeg/ZMFgo5UD6IZvCOoeplrmK9npYZXJyejZNJ8WzDSfFsw\"/><figcaption>趙夕汐（微博@趙夕汐_）</figcaption></figure><p>演員方面，男女主角劉浩群、趙夕汐皆為短劇圈人氣演員。劉浩群從話劇表演起步，近年活躍於短劇演出，代表作包括《東北愛情往事》系列，曾被網民稱撞臉王一博。即將作為新一代「星女郎」的趙夕汐，近年憑《愛在黎明前降落》《聲色犬馬》《藏珠》等作品累積知名度，氣質出眾，也被部分媒體形容外形神似另一星女郎黃聖依。</p><p>延伸閲讀：周星馳《金豬玉葉》劇情聚焦網路詐騙　故事貼地卻因一關鍵惹負評</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：周星馳《金豬玉葉》劇情聚焦網路詐騙　故事貼地卻因一關鍵惹負評】前兩集內容裡，《金豬玉葉》形象展現了「殺豬盤」的底層邏輯。（《金豬玉葉》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161394632396800102789.png/gFGcl3vjuEFx-nVrT4rYvnbkXwy8QdoBtYlh5bWJYeU\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：周星馳《金豬玉葉》劇情聚焦網路詐騙　故事貼地卻因一關鍵惹負評】前兩集內容裡，《金豬玉葉》形象展現了「殺豬盤」的底層邏輯。（《金豬玉葉》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前兩集內容裡，《金豬玉葉》形象展現了「殺豬盤」的底層邏輯。（《金豬玉葉》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161397245579264678932.png/q210-92YGZQ08dckN9k3VQzduSxoS8xg19nQ1NfZ0NQ\"/><figcaption>前兩集內容裡，《金豬玉葉》形象展現了「殺豬盤」的底層邏輯。（《金豬玉葉》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一些觀眾對《金豬玉葉》滿口稱讚，認可知名導演入局對微短劇質感的提升作用。（視覺中國）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240203/830525177136680960820397.jpeg/2TabC-l56nh--ziiaSQ2Uy9qH97Zox_NrQITEa0CExE\"/><figcaption>一些觀眾對《金豬玉葉》滿口稱讚，認可知名導演入局對微短劇質感的提升作用。（視覺中國）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周星馳期望透過「九五二七劇場」帶給觀眾更多歡樂。（抖音網站圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877162024851738624984627.png/9jZWlO1YXJI9muVY_9DI7oWbrEq_pk9u6eMKmunjCpo\"/><figcaption>周星馳期望透過「九五二七劇場」帶給觀眾更多歡樂。（抖音網站圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"觀眾是稱讚還是失望，《金豬玉葉》能不能被視為精品短劇，其實並不重要。（抖音網站圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877162115268349952072834.png/xYOsEDE_pUiKPPV7MYPL5t2_uuQFn-RQTEsWZ0xLFmc\"/><figcaption>觀眾是稱讚還是失望，《金豬玉葉》能不能被視為精品短劇，其實並不重要。（抖音網站圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161544335626240603425.png/6eqtvjq7FMgEuGU8eVI53DZnuctf9aNndEqMNnRKjDY\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161546571321344612785.png/J-80Kth9Gepq_stDxih6Hi6PrmJ2t5JfsfnEubH5xLk\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161548970594304572806.png/wybmlssjh_41B8b_WxWgS8eZxoaizq7aEsUi9RLFIvU\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161551034322944937248.png/GCPRnyYtoDugr3_rg0d_LtMH5MMmYRPrHHgPPBx4Dzw\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161543798624256891652.png/vFLwznq_pUsGFdiEYOuWctz9AedaUE9tVVgEZVVYBGU\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161546093039616074936.png/77S4QuxmBOj-GFrn9DOx_lz14kxpFstDsK-XubCvl7k\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161548492312576810395.png/afE-QRhut8JbtsYRrJ56grILhwz1qqxUwH-cQ8B_nEM\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161550807699456195087.png/F99Q9RSf7PhUMPmY6T7aM-x_kOPKc14YmJz0u5ic9Ls\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161553173417984815046.png/Uhn1wtQcP5CGDgjLwJpLG4oFFl90HoU4GebEwhnmxMI\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《金豬玉葉》劇照\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877161541776969728260589.png/uM3dv4nAxoB43c43Az6mvfgUpTSK0FsfZs7YNmbO2DY\"/><figcaption>《金豬玉葉》劇照</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T12:24:47.910351+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1197,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}